  "description": "Dark Quest: Remastered is a turn-based fantasy dungeon crawler inspired by classic board games and tabletop adventures.\n\nA dark sorcerer has built a dungeon beneath the village of Darkwood, unleashing his minions upon the land. Lead a party of heroes into dangerous dungeons, plan your moves carefully on a grid-based battlefield, and defeat the forces of evil threatening the realm.\n\nPerfect for short or long play sessions, Dark Quest: Remastered delivers strategic combat, charming fantasy style, and timeless gameplay—now fully remastered for modern consoles.\n\nFeatures:\n- Turn-based, grid-based combat\n- Party-based dungeon exploration\n- Classic fantasy adventure\n- Remastered visuals and improvements\n- Optimized for handheld and docked play",
